{"unit_id":"PerryLink__dsh-library#card-zh","repo":"PerryLink/dsh-library","commit":"3298a446a2552a884a9d1013223e7f76099d8c38","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-library（DSH 插件，适用于 DSH 客户端）：为 DSH 建立本地文档知识库并进行语义与关键词混合检索。它通过 storage domain 保存分块和嵌入，并注册六个工具及 /library 命令。功能包括导入和移除 Markdown 或纯文本、按相关性与多样性搜索、将结果注入 agent、核验回答引用，以及诊断检索质量。适合希望 agent 查询本机文档的用户。默认使用本地 hash embedding，也可配置本机 Ollama 或自定义 embedding 子进程。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:130-138","src/index.ts:758-999"]}
{"unit_id":"PerryLink__dsh-library#card-en","repo":"PerryLink/dsh-library","commit":"3298a446a2552a884a9d1013223e7f76099d8c38","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-library gives DSH a local document library. Six tools import, remove, list, search, check citations, and diagnose retrieval; /library summarizes indexes. Search combines semantic and keyword ranking. Local hash embeddings work by default, with optional Ollama or an embedding command.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:130-138","src/index.ts:758-999"]}
